dges’"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"directions and the roots dropped: every reached vertex, in the tree’s index order as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Arborescence(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" lists them (unreached ones left out), and one edge (parent, child) per"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reached vertex with a parent, in that order. Edge positions are the forest’s own: edge k"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"joins the k-th listed vertex with a parent to its parent; the graph’s edge stays"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"tree.parentEdge(of:)"},{"type":"text","text":". O(n); the vertices are hashed once, into the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"forest’s lookup table, unless they are the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Int"},{"type":"text","text":"s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"0..<k"},{"type":"text","text":" in order."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/documentation\/ShortestPaths\/Trees\/Forest\/init(_:)","url":"\/documentation\/shortestpaths\/trees\/forest\/init(_:)"},"doc://Grafluent/documentation/Grafluent/Trees-Tree-Extensions":{"title":"Extensions to Tree","url":"\/documentation\/grafluent\/trees-tree-extensions","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Members other modules add to "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trees\/documentation\/Trees\/Tree"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Grafluent\/documentation\/Grafluent\/Trees-Tree-Extensions","type":"topic","role":"collectionGroup","kind":"article"},"doc://Trees/documentation/Trees/Forest":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Forest","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Forest","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"Forest","abstract":[{"text":"A forest: an acyclic undirected graph, possibly empty, so a disjoint union of trees (an","typ